		     took, undo my last skip. Each only raises its flag to 1; the SERVER does the work and puts
		     it back to 0 (SalvageMenu), so the same row can be pressed again. 0 = nothing asked, which
		     is also what an unwritten CVar reads as. -->
		<buff name="buffDaSalvCmdSkipLast" hidden="true">
